# A chat archived by alice's other device (chat.archive) leaves Home; Home's filter → 已归档: it is there, by day.
# Restored from its row (还原): it leaves the archive, the station has it back.
timeout 120000
until 端到端测试
log do: peer archive 要归档的对话 {T} post:归档前的回复 {T}
# (its row may come and go on Home meanwhile: the other device archives it once the station has it)
wait 30000
gone 要归档的对话 {T}
shot 1-home
tap icon:filter
until =已归档
tap =已归档
until 要归档的对话 {T}
until 归档前的回复 {T}
shot 2-archive
tap1 icon:retry
gone 要归档的对话 {T}
shot 3-restored
